    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANOMONAUT</strong> - The roguelike where each player only has one chance:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESIGN YOUR SHIP\u00a0</strong><br>Before each mission, choose one of five upgrades<i>(?)</i> for your ship, the <strong>DELTA</strong>.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/e16afbb4743f5d109423d11863908e87.poster.avif?t=1751909953\" width=500 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/e16afbb4743f5d109423d11863908e87.webm?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/e16afbb4743f5d109423d11863908e87.mp4?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<br>(<i>Consider skipping the fish food fabricator.)\u00a0</i>\u00a0 <br>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR CRAFT\u00a0</strong><br>Utilize the Delta's onboard simulator to hone your skill in a no-risk environment.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/411513a8b0bd00ea21480b2b3730ab62.poster.avif?t=1751909953\" width=500 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/411513a8b0bd00ea21480b2b3730ab62.webm?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/411513a8b0bd00ea21480b2b3730ab62.mp4?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0<br>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPLETE THE MISSION\u00a0\u00a0</strong><br>Each one is deadlier than the last. The only way out is through, pilot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.poster.avif?t=1751909953\" width=500 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.webm?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.mp4?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>\u00a0</i><br><i>Choices made along the way will shape your entire journey with ANOMONAUT.\u00a0</i>  <br><i>However, should ANOMONAUT's ship be destroyed, your journey will <strong>end</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANOMONAUT's current playable mission will advance each <strong>real-world</strong> day.<br>These missions will ultimately lead to an end of  ANOMONAUT's story.   <br>Think of ANOMONAUT as something we can experience in real-time.<br>Further details will be revealed closer to release. Know that accessibility is a priority.  <br>Thank you for your interest in ANOMONAUT.\u00a0 </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANOMONAUT</strong> - The roguelike where each player only has one chance:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESIGN YOUR SHIP\u00a0</strong><br>Before each mission, choose one of five upgrades<i>(?)</i> for your ship, the <strong>DELTA</strong>.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/e16afbb4743f5d109423d11863908e87.poster.avif?t=1751909953\" width=500 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/e16afbb4743f5d109423d11863908e87.webm?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/e16afbb4743f5d109423d11863908e87.mp4?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<br>(<i>Consider skipping the fish food fabricator.)\u00a0</i>\u00a0 <br>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR CRAFT\u00a0</strong><br>Utilize the Delta's onboard simulator to hone your skill in a no-risk environment.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/411513a8b0bd00ea21480b2b3730ab62.poster.avif?t=1751909953\" width=500 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/411513a8b0bd00ea21480b2b3730ab62.webm?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/411513a8b0bd00ea21480b2b3730ab62.mp4?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0<br>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPLETE THE MISSION\u00a0\u00a0</strong><br>Each one is deadlier than the last. The only way out is through, pilot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.poster.avif?t=1751909953\" width=500 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.webm?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.mp4?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>\u00a0</i><br><i>Choices made along the way will shape your entire journey with ANOMONAUT.\u00a0</i>  <br><i>However, should ANOMONAUT's ship be destroyed, your journey will <strong>end</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANOMONAUT's current playable mission will advance each <strong>real-world</strong> day.<br>These missions will ultimately lead to an end of  ANOMONAUT's story.   <br>Think of ANOMONAUT as something we can experience in real-time.<br>Further details will be revealed closer to release. Know that accessibility is a priority.  <br>Thank you for your interest in ANOMONAUT.\u00a0 </h2>",
